# Issue #787: the reporter-position alias path over a user procedure that never reaches `return`.
# `define forward` takes a built-in name, so phase-1 registration raises `ol-reserved-word` and
# the program halts before the reporter is evaluated: the event stream is empty and no
# `ol-no-output` is produced. Re-legalise `define forward` and this fixture reddens, leading the
# next reader to #787.
define forward
  print 1
end
print fd